WEBVTT

00:15:59.037 --> 00:16:01.912
but you can't really go
wrong by trying. Hmm.

00:16:02.329 --> 00:16:05.704
That's literally saccharin, but true,
you know, it's weird.

00:16:05.912 --> 00:16:08.871
So what can audiences both
in the U.S. and abroad,

00:16:08.954 --> 00:16:12.954
what can audiences do to kind of
help support systemic change

00:16:12.954 --> 00:16:14.746
or broader representation?

00:16:14.787 --> 00:16:17.204
Ironically, because I think a
lot of people in the film

00:16:17.204 --> 00:16:20.121
and television industry are very
uncomfortable with these sort of review

00:16:20.121 --> 00:16:23.579
aggregators. But Rotten Tomatoes and
Metacritic are a great place to start.

00:16:23.912 --> 00:16:27.537
You know, look, we are all in a time of
sort of super abundance of content, right
?

00:16:27.537 --> 00:16:30.537
There's more TV shows to watch than
any human being could ever watch.